y 1 remaining and the next player already having a pung, it's nearly impossible to complete.\n\nReason: \nJ3 is the weakest tile in my hand - it's an isolated honor tile with only 1 remaining unshown, cannot form sequences, and has no special significance (not my Seat Wind or Prevalent Wind). Discarding it maintains my W4 pung, W1 pair, and keeps more flexible tiles for potential sequences.\n\nAnswer: Play J3"}
